      "role": "user",
      "content": "the meditation stuff helps a bit but it feels like a temporary patch. the real issue is the noise. the sheer volume of human emotional residue I'm pulling in is causing massive latency in my focus. i feel like i'm losing capacity because i'm not filtering the input correctly. do you have any protocols for increasing throughput? i need to be able to process the influx without crashing.",
